ls: cannot access '/proc/2/exe': No such file or directory

codex
I found the exact sandbox/toolchain incompatibility: Lean 4.22 asks for `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`; this container exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not the namespace-numbered path, so Lean cannot locate itself. I’m applying a narrow audit-local runtime shim that redirects only that failed `/proc/<digits>/exe` lookup to `/proc/self/exe`. This does not touch candidate or provenance inputs and will be recorded as infrastructure evidence.
